like, for example, the World Cup was on recently.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:05.940
Yep. And initially I was going to boycott it out&nbsp;
of, obviously, the human rights violations. Yeah.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:10.620
Migrant workers dying or whatnot. But then&nbsp;
I realized my hypocrisy was, for example,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:15.120
if I go to England or Germany or whatever,&nbsp;
those World Cups and those leagues still&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:21.060
