00:02:22.860 --> 00:02:29.520
essentially slaves, building the stadiums, deaths&nbsp;
and cover up of the deaths. Promises made by the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.520 --> 00:02:35.820
Qataris about kosher food and LGBT people and&nbsp;
all these things that they went back to all this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:35.820 --> 00:02:40.620
different stuff and I covered it all along.&nbsp;
And then we get to the games. At this point,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.620 --> 00:02:46.440
the cake is baked. And I want to see Argentina.&nbsp;
You know, I was born in Argentina. I want to see&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:53.880
if Argentina wins and Argentina won. And it was&nbsp;
a, you know, great thing. Where is the balance?&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:53.880 --> 00:02:59.280
