okay with it in the grand scheme of my life. And&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:04.260 --> 00:03:08.940
everybody has to kind of decide for themselves.
Speaker 3: Yeah, I kind of feel like in a sense,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.940 --> 00:03:13.800
