of act in our favor, try and orchestrate some way&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:47.820
where it's reasonable for me to be an ethical&nbsp;
consumer. It's done on. You can just sort of.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:51.889
Boycott every little thing because&nbsp;
that would just make my life miserable.&nbsp;

00:03:51.889 --> 00:03:56.640
Speaker 1: I agree with that. I also&nbsp;
